<section id="the-question" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="the-question">The question</h2>
<p>WRITE HERE. ~100 words. You write R for every assignment; R appears in 1 of 261 postings. What do employers actually ask for, and has it shifted enough in a year to change what you should study?</p>
</section>
<section id="where-the-data-comes-from" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="where-the-data-comes-from">Where the data comes from</h2>
<p>WRITE HERE. ~120 words. HN monthly hiring thread, one top-level comment per employer. Same month a year apart holds seasonality fixed. robots.txt allows /item, disallows /submitted, 30-second delay, pages cached. One sentence on the API.</p>
</section>
